  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br><br>Spread your wings and relax at Butterfly Cottage, a charming one-story retreat nestled in the heart of the highly coveted Grove by the Sea community. This dog-friendly home offers a peaceful coastal atmosphere with an easy-access layout, making it perfect for families and four-legged friends alike. With four complimentary bikes included, you are perfectly positioned to explore the scenic trails and sugar-white sands of Seagrove Beach.<br><br><br><br>The Space:<br><br>Butterfly Cottage features an inviting open-concept floor plan designed for effortless vacationing. The single-story layout ensures everyone stays connected, from the comfortable living area to the fully equipped kitchen. Whether you’re enjoying a quiet morning on the porch or gathering for a family meal after a day in the sun, this home provides a serene and welcoming environment.<br><br><br><br>Key Features:<br><br>•\tConvenient 1-Story Floor Plan<br><br>•\tDog Friendly!<br><br>•\t4 Complimentary Bikes Included<br><br>•\tFully Equipped Kitchen<br><br>•\tGas Grill for Outdoor Cooking<br><br>•\tHigh-Speed WiFi & Smart TVs<br><br><br><br>Sleeping Arrangements:<br><br>•\tPrimary Bedroom – 1st Floor – King Bed – Private Ensuite Bathroom<br><br>•\tGuest Bedroom 1 – 1st Floor – King Bed – Shared Hall Bathroom<br><br>•\tGuest Bedroom 2 – 1st Floor – 2 Twin Beds – Shared Hall Bathroom<br><br><br><br>Neighborhood: <br><br>Grove by the Sea is one of Seagrove Beach’s most beloved neighborhoods, famous for its winding brick-paved streets and lush canopy of mature oaks and pines. This peaceful, low-density community offers a nostalgic \"Old Florida\" feel while being just minutes away from the vibrant energy of Seaside. It’s the perfect spot for those who value privacy, nature, and a quiet place to walk the dog or ride bikes.<br><br><br><br>Community Amenities:<br><br>•\tTwo Resort-Style Community Pools (One Seasonally Heated)<br><br>•\tTennis Courts<br><br>•\tShaded Walking Paths<br><br><br><br>Beach Access :<br><br>S. Andalusia Pubic Access- Just a short walk or bike ride through the neighborhood trails to the emerald waters of 30A.<br><br><br><br>Guest Access Guest Access: <br><br>Guests are given a unique door code for their stay.<br><br>Check-In: 4:00 PM <br><br>Check-Out: 10:00 AM <br><br><br><br>Parking: 2 Vehicles Max. <br><br>No Boats, Trailers, or U-Hauls. <br><br>No street parking.<br><br><br><br>Other Things to Note House Rules:<br><br>•\tMust be 25 or older to rent. Primary guest must stay at the property.<br><br>•\tNo smoking. No parties or events.<br><br>•\tDog Friendly- All Dogs Must be Approved. $175 fee per dog. <br><br>•\tThe primary guest is required to sign the Kismet Properties Renter’s Agreement and upload a photo ID.<br><br><br><br>What We Provide:<br><br>•\tInitial starter supply of paper products, soap, and basic kitchen essentials.<br><br>•\tAll bedding linens and bath towels (please bring your own beach towels).<br><br><br><br>Guest Access:<br><br>Guests are given a unique door code for their stay.<br><br><br><br>The Neighborhood:<br><br>Grove by the Sea is one of Seagrove Beach’s most beloved neighborhoods, famous for its winding brick-paved streets and lush canopy of mature oaks and pines. This peaceful, low-density community offers a nostalgic \"Old Florida\" feel while being just minutes away from the vibrant energy of Seaside. It’s the perfect spot for those who value privacy, nature, and a quiet place to walk the dog or ride bikes.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
